    "body": "Actually, ignore me, that was a stupid idea. :facepalm:  \r\nWe used to have a similar setting for the Python module to prevent version display inside dirs with random `.py` file/s https://github.com/starship/starship/pull/692 And that sounds pretty much similar to your `ignoreActiveConfigFile` proposal. So let's add a new setting based on established precedence:\r\n```toml\r\n[gcloud]\r\nscan_for_user_config = false # defaults to true, controls `active_config` fallback\r\n```\r\n\r\nWhat do you think about this one?",
