    "body": "since I started to use gcloud too I would like to have this (or a similar) feature too. \r\n\r\nWas there an agreement on the design of the config? And if this would be accepted? \r\n\r\nMaybe this approach? \r\n\r\n> I just had a quick look at that config value for the python module. Following the naming of the python config option maybe this makes more sense.\r\n> \r\n> ```toml\r\n> [gcloud]\r\n> scan_for_env_var = true # disabling this would ignore CLOUDSDK_ACTIVE_CONFIG_NAME and only use the config file\r\n> scan_for_config_file = true # disabling this would ignore the config file and only use the CLOUDSDK_ACTIVE_CONFIG_NAME\r\n> ```\r\n\r\n",
